#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:31
#: f59c3343fbf24d549028f3b2a9a81acd
msgid "All H-RTK GNSS models come with a GH 10-pin connector/cable that is compatible with the Pixhawk family and many other autopilots."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:33
#: bba4b9a5b2d44e248f225c08eb3e84d0
msgid "The cables/connectors may be modified to connect to other autopilot boards, using the Pin Map information provided above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:35
#: 63e2704b8be04543b706dd72e5bc0e97
msgid "For Pixhawk Cube 2.1 variant that does not come with a 10-way GPS port and hence requires connector re-termination, note that the RX port on the GPS module should feed into the port labelled GPS_RX (TX of autopilot board) on the autopilot board. Also, the GPS1 port is 8-way only, which can be circumvented by leaving 3v3 and buzzer lines out."
msgstr ""

